cermat...

70
00:05:24,577 --> 00:05:27,687
Ganda, gelembung, kerja keras dan masalah.

71
00:05:27,711 --> 00:05:31,038
Gairah membara, taruhannya berlipat ganda.

72
00:05:31,062 --> 00:05:34,826
Sehingga hampir selalu
mendapat angka enam.

73
00:05:36,458 --> 00:05:39,133
Aku tidak tahu caranya, Savage,

74
00:05:39,157 --> 00:05:42,005
