76
00:05:46,425 --> 00:05:48,274
Beraninya kau.

77
00:05:49,689 --> 00:05:51,538
Reginald sering ditugaskan...

78
00:05:51,909 --> 00:05:53,866
Emm. Siap! dengan
menyelesaikan berbagai
pertengkaran keuangan Chauncey

79
00:05:53,867 --> 00:05:57,020
dan perselisihan melalui duel
pedang atau pistol.

80
00:05:57,044 --> 00:05:59,545
Api!

81
00:05:59,569 --> 00:06:01,416
Serta membantu dalam menghindari

82
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:04,985
