87
00:06:13,887 --> 00:06:16,520
Jangan ikut campur denganku, Nak!

88
00:06:16,673 --> 00:06:19,260
Aku pernah mendengar rumor bahwa paket aku
telah terjual dua kali,

89
00:06:19,284 --> 00:06:21,177
